      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">6. Donations</h2>
        <p>Donations are voluntary and non-refundable. Funds support the development and maintenance of open-source assistive technology. P31 Labs is a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit (EIN 42-1888158).</p>
